            </figcaption>

            <figure class="ons-chart-image">
              <img src="/prototypes/assets/fig-1-crime.png" alt="Figure 1 crime chart">
              <figcaption class="ons-image__caption">Source - Annual Population Survey from the Office for National Statistics</figcaption>
            </figure>
